{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_19", "source_id": "670d12720000000021002837", "title": "一些油痘肌超爱的狠货（深圳秋冬天版）", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_670d12720000000021002837", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1548, "evidence_unit_count": 45, "original_evidence_unit_count": 45, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["1、点阵仪：用过很多家用仪器，但最终都是闲置在角落里吃灰，但是这台就不一样了，效果好到我恨不得每天都用", "用料方面也很舍得下本，小花风车子提取物、益生元、瑞士大厂NAD+等等，变灭🔥边修护边调节🦠群，特别适合爱长痘痘的油痘敏肌姐妹～", "非常保湿，完全可以替代唇膏 而且颜色也很美", "VITAMIN C SERUM 0.17FL.OZ.(5mL)", "HEDONE HEDONE 最近亮亮的眼睛", "8、最后分享一只我个人超爱的唇蜜品牌hedone，但这个在我直播间买不到，因为它要闭店了，目前正在清仓，125三只", "这是我用过试用感最高级的唇蜜，别的品牌唇蜜就算质地再轻盈，涂上嘴你还是能感觉，这是彩妆，触感和护唇产品是有区别的"], "retained_quotes": ["8、最后分享一只我个人超爱的唇蜜品牌hedone，但这个在我直播间买不到，因为它要闭店了，目前正在清仓，125三只", "这是我用过试用感最高级的唇蜜，别的品牌唇蜜就算质地再轻盈，涂上嘴你还是能感觉，这是彩妆，触感和护唇产品是有区别的"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_670d12720000000021002837/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_670d12720000000021002837/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_670d12720000000021002837/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_670d12720000000021002837/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "e9b3fd25e03c5feb4237391a6ef8a33cdbdae90e0978f73930d0ffe133d4ed44", "card_hash": "849507f70fac1e4b2a9657e2ab720f657dca135f02a36a6d92