{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_19", "source_id": "6709fab80000000021008902", "title": "一些能让油痘敏肌肤质飞升的护肤搭配", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6709fab80000000021008902", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1569, "evidence_unit_count": 48, "original_evidence_unit_count": 48, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 189, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 作为11年游斗机 游斗名我也经历过", "质地是这种 非常轻盈的奶冻质地 我非常喜欢 它比老板要更加的", "都安利了之后 他们都是从半性半移 到现在已经是完全离不开了", "它是那种 成片成片的痘印 特别严重 再连续用了 两瓶三绣精华之后", "我们油皮脸上 就会有那种 很健康的水光机了", "但是我每天还是收到很多解论的问题 说不知道自己适合什么 所以今天是一期保护机", "皮肤就恢复到 干净细腻的状态 真的很牛 如果这三个 你们一定要选一个的话"], "retained_quotes": ["但是我每天还是收到很多解论的问题 说不知道自己适合什么 所以今天是一期保护机", "皮肤就恢复到 干净细腻的状态 真的很牛 如果这三个 你们一定要选一个的话"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6709fab80000000021008902/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6709fab80000000021008902/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6709fab80000000021008902/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6709fab80000000021008902/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "ccf3f7b58b03ef83a29224b31263ef49bbde1490a5b67a5424afcff53889418f", "card_hash": "b470a9c1b192647309a098f4ebae59f23b0729b4ca6a8feb46b082eb4e6204d4", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_19", "source_id": "6708e2ec000000001a0224e9", "title": "不花冤枉钱！双11直播间必买清单🧾", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6708e2ec000000001a0224e9", "topic_family": "商业售后与购买决策", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1368, "evidence_unit_count": 42, "original_evidence_unit_count": 42, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 155, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 今天这期视频想来给你们分享一下 我12号直播间有哪些东西是很值得买的", "油皮的姐妹真的可以试试它 带来就是我的 长年绑一金环 三修冰环", "离不开这两个东西了 他们让我脸颊 这两边的毛孔 变得细腻了很多很多", "但是又温和的一款 去年呢 我为了给大家找一款好的导出液 我前相会会用好多好多", "然后它这次的机制也是非常好的 325买50克 送55克的中小样 送的比买的还要多", "因为它的消耗比较快 所以呢 我推荐大家入手双之装 而且双之装的机制", "首先是这个家庭版的光复 它其实是家用点正义 我很少给大家上对这种家用类的仪器"], "retained_quotes": ["因为它的消耗比较快 所以呢 我推荐大家入手双之装 而且双之装的机制", "首先是这个家庭版的光复 它其实是家用点正义 我很少给大家上对这种家用类的仪器"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6708e2ec000000001a0224e9/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6708e2ec000000001a0224e9/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6708e2ec000000001a0224e9/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6708e2ec000000001a0224e9/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "9295da97a1a04da7e97617ab1fbe46555397c3b0db5b9b8c8afb6922449186de", "card_hash": "f46b4ea7088d16fbef30dd5ea626211f1521522dd22b5800138d29f60d832e91", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learne