{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_19", "source_id": "670214c3000000001b022274", "title": "3年没去美容院，皮肤反而更好了", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_670214c3000000001b022274", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "time_feedback", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1804, "evidence_unit_count": 55, "original_evidence_unit_count": 55, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["11年油痘肌，为了改善我的痘痘、闭口、毛孔，前几年光是在美容院do项目就花了不下6位数", "晚上花10分钟打一下，没有恢复期，第二天就能正常化妆了", "STEP3敷白膜浮出毛孔里的油脂 STEP4用粉刺棒清除浮出的油脂", "毕*之研厚脸皮冻干次抛 葆*美衰曼霜 MEDATURE", "STEP6洗脸后用清爽的产品护肤 并用基础保湿贴片面膜加压", "这套能快速下红灭🔥，强韧屏障的routine，我每次翻车或者敏敏的时候，都会把它拉出来救急，基本上做完一次，第二天皮肤就感觉舒服很多", "所以我琢磨出了这个家庭版海菲秀 在家一周一次，每次成本就几十块钱，效果却非常好，一下子皮肤就光滑了、闭口粉刺减少90%"], "retained_quotes": ["这套能快速下红灭🔥，强韧屏障的routine，我每次翻车或者敏敏的时候，都会把它拉出来救急，基本上做完一次，第二天皮肤就感觉舒服很多", "所以我琢磨出了这个家庭版海菲秀 在家一周一次，每次成本就几十块钱，效果却非常好，一下子皮肤就光滑了、闭口粉刺减少90%"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_670214c3000000001b022274/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_670214c3000000001b022274/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_670214c3000000001b022274/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_670214c3000000001b022274/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "c0c41c4e6f76c6d06c2e3c6a3c700603fd5a83ddb73d0adb26188d440d2828ae", "card_hash": "545217f12b3e245accfcd7558e6de664e4b1d8c3f7848582ada3fc67e